(3258, 514, 'short_description', 'ProZ Waterproof Tape is a super-strong, rubberized tape designed to patch, bond, seal, and repair virtually anything! It can be applied in hot or cold conditions, on wet or dry surfaces, and even underwater.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nProZ Waterproof Tape instantly seals out water, air, and moisture, creating a durable, flexible, and watertight barrier.'),
