(16, 1, '2025-08-10 18:52:06', '2025-08-10 10:52:06', '<h2>FIND A PROZ<br />RETAILER</h2>		<p>Find the right product for your specific project requirements in a few<br />simple steps with our easy to use product finder. All you need to do<br />is answer a few basic application questions and we\'ll do the rest</p>[store_locator]', 'Retail', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'retail', '', '', '2025-08-20 11:16:37', '2025-08-20 03:16:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost/proz/?page_id=16', 7, 'page', '', 0),
